Recommends: clamav, network-manager, dnsmasq-base
Suggests: ufw
Description: simple virus scanning, firewall and Internet protection
 LibreWard is a cross-platform security and privacy desktop application. On
 Linux it scans files with ClamAV, manages UFW or firewalld, and blocks
 unwanted website domains with a local DNS filter in front of NetworkManager
 or systemd-resolved.
